# Project instructions

This project's guidelines live in `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root. Read that
file in full before doing any work in this session, and follow it exactly
as written — it covers project status, how to run/smoke-test the game,
concept, tech stack, and scope philosophy (which slice is active and what
not to build ahead into).

If `CLAUDE.md` changes during a session, re-read it rather than relying on
what you already saw.
